Just finished a game trying to apply what I learned from watching a
Marvin ttyrec game.  It just happened to be genocide-less.  The main
reason was I never found a genocide scroll and was trying to hurry up
and finish.  It was my shortest game by about 40000 turns so that is
an improvement.  I skipped a bunch of stuff and tried to minimize my
trips up and down through the dungeon to shops and altars.

It was interesting not genociding - I usually do all L's, h's and ;'s
but I blew right by all of these once I got my AC down to -39
(eventually -40).

I found two big shops early in the game - one was a potion shop with a
ton of stuff in it on level 2.

Turn 5679 I got my first wish - GDSM from a magic lamp.

found a touchstone in the mines and blessed it and id'd gems a bunch -
gave to unicorns and got cash from shopkeepers.

Got a two more magic lamps and a second wish.

By 27273 I got the WOW from the castle.

tried to not fully explore maze levels.  Came back to haunt me because
I missed Vlad's tower.  Had to fully explore a few levels to find it.

42326 - got Candelabrum

Found gold detection scroll around 43912  then went to kill the wizard
and got out.

